sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as React SPA
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DS as datasets.py
    participant RUN as runner.py
    participant PROV as Provider
    participant MET as metrics.py
    participant SEM as semantic.py
    participant JUD as judge.py
    participant DB as SQLite

    User->>UI: Select dataset, provider, model
    UI->>API: POST /api/runs
    API->>DS: load_dataset(dataset_file)
    DS->>DS: compute SHA-256
    DS-->>API: cases + sha256 + version
    API->>DB: INSERT benchmark_runs (status=running)
    API-->>UI: RunSummary (202-style acknowledgement)

    loop For each test case
        API->>PROV: generate(prompt)
        alt Provider succeeds
            PROV-->>API: candidate text + tokens + latency
            API->>MET: evaluate_case(method, candidate, reference)
            MET-->>API: deterministic result
            opt Semantic scoring enabled
                API->>SEM: similarity(candidate, reference)
                SEM-->>API: cosine similarity
            end
            opt Judge enabled
                API->>JUD: score(case, candidate)
                JUD-->>API: 5-dimension scorecard
            end
        else Provider fails
            PROV-->>API: ProviderError (sanitized)
            API->>API: record error_category + message
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT benchmark_case_results
        API->>DB: UPDATE run progress counters
    end

    API->>DB: UPDATE benchmark_runs (final status)
    Note over API,DB: completed | partial_failure | failed
    UI->>API: GET /api/runs (polled every 10s)
    API-->>UI: RunSummary list
